AUDIO: 'image. Then going back to SeaArt 2 I uploaded that video of myself along with that image of me wearing the superhero outfit and along with this prompt it gave me this video. Now for this one I actually did do a 4K resolution output'

[03:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and I think that 4K detail really comes through and looks incredibly sharp. Now it does still have that kind of AI look to it but I think going from my original footage to this I am really happy with how it turned out. Another tool that you'

[03:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'can use in OpenArt is their dedicated VFX tool which uses B Bull\'s Switch X model. Now this tool allows you to kind of select parts of your video to mask it out and then change the rest of the image. I have actually made a full'

[03:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'dedicated video on how to use this tool so if you do want to check that out, I\'ve left a link to it down below. And here is the result from using that tool. So, as you can see, I\'ve masked out myself and then just changed the rest of the video. Now, apart from the iron bar'

