AUDIO: 'I think it does a pretty good job at making it look like a realistic-looking mask pull down. I think the mask pull down effect is a pretty fun one to play around with, and I\'m pretty sure all of you could do a better job than what I\'ve'

[05:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'done. I feel like these video models could work really well if you need to go back and do some reshoots, but you don\'t necessarily have the time or be able to go to that location. If it\'s just a few seconds, then you could get away with changing the outfits and the background,'

[05:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and you can get some pretty believable-looking shots. Now, let\'s jump into my wizard spell-casting effect shots. So, I wanted to replicate some kind of wizard dueling magic shots. So, I filmed myself just holding a pen and'

[05:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'pretending to cast some spells. I I the first frame of my video and it used GP image 2. Along with this prompt, it gave me this awesome image. So, it\'s put me in wizard robes inside a castle, and as'

[05:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you can see, it\'s changed that pen I\'m holding to a wand, and we\'ve got some nice blue energy magic coming out of it. Now, I am wearing my cap in the image, so I did just upload that again, and I'

[06:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'prompted it to give him a wizard hat. So, remember, if there\'s something off in your image, then just re-upload that image and prompt it with what you want to change. So, now I\'ve got my fashionable wizard hat on, I can now upload this with my reference footage.'

[06:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Now, as you can see in the reference footage, I am moving around a bit, and I was using a gimbal with head tracking just to add a bit more dynamic movement instead of just a static shot. So, here is the Gemini Omni version. Now, I think'

[06:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it looks okay. It has added some extra movements in there, which I didn\'t do in the reference video, but overall, it looks pretty good. Then, jumping over to SeaArt 2, this is what I got. I think overall, it looks a lot better in terms'

[06:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'of detail and just the overall look of it, but I think the magic coming out of the wand could have looked a bit better. So, this time in the prompt, I changed it to he\'s shooting a constant stream of blue magic out of his wand, and then I'

[06:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'added things like fog and mist in the background and destruction and falling debris in the background just to add a bit more going on in the video. And I think it was a lot better. We\'ve got that kind of constant stream of magic'

[07:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
