[07:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and gave it the prompt of add cinematic haze and shallow depth of field in the background and foreground. It has kind of taken down the contrast, but it\'s added in these kind of out of focus elements into the shot. I think it looks'

[07:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'a lot more cinematic. So, when I ran that image through SeaArt 2, it gave me this video. I think this looks really, really nice. I like how in this video it seems like the magic is timed to the wand when I actually flick it out. I was'

[07:45] [scene:talk]
