[09:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the shelf and here\'s my version in Omni where I prompted it to make it look like I\'m holding onto a branch in a fast moving river. Then when using C Dance 2 along with this reference image I made, I was blown away with the results. This'

[09:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'is a 4K output, so it looks a very detailed, but I think you can see just how good this shot looks. From me holding my shelf to this, it\'s pretty incredible. The water physics look'

