[10:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'footage, think of the lighting and how you want it to look in the final video. I\'m just very, very impressed with how this one came out. The 4K definitely adds a lot of detail into it. I would like to know what your thoughts on this shot are in the comment section down'

[10:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'below. Having the ability to film something in a few minutes to then generating this in a few minutes, I think it\'s pretty incredible. So yeah, I would like to know your thoughts in the comments down below on this shot. With the awesome success of the Backrooms'

